23. COMMAND PIPELINE
Every model mutation follows:
REQUEST
 ↓
AUTHORIZATION
 ↓
PROJECT LOAD
 ↓
REVISION CHECK
 ↓
COMMAND PARSE
 ↓
TARGET RESOLUTION
 ↓
